{"nodes": [{"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_ultron", "label": "Ultron (personal AI home-lab system)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One implementation of any given piece of logic; dashboard and Discord bot are thin callers of the same backend functions Ultron's own chat tools use."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_backend", "label": "Flask Backend (app.py)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Windows-primary with Linux/Pi fallback; hosts system/container/storage/security monitoring and the Claude tool-use chat loop."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_dashboard", "label": "HTML/JS Dashboard", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_discord_bot", "label": "Discord Bot (bot.py)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Built as a thin HTTP client of the backend so no logic is duplicated."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_llm_chat_brain", "label": "LLM Chat Brain (Claude)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_ethical_hacking_agent", "label": "Ethical Hacking Agent (refused outright)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Never built; standing hard rule in the system prompt against exploit code or attack tooling, even under 'my own home lab' framing."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_investment_agent", "label": "Investment/Financial Predictive Agent (reinterpreted)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Refused as specified (trade proposals); reinterpreted into a legitimate factual record-keeping agent. Specific trading advice remains hard-refused, including about the user's own recorded trades."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_trade_record_agent", "label": "Crypto/Trade Record & Tax Agent", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Built as FIFO-based record-keeping, explicitly not advice; disclaimer embedded in every API response and exported CSV, not just shown once in the UI."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_home_lab_monitor", "label": "Home Lab Monitor & Command Router", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Built first, as the backend's core monitoring layer."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_coding_subagent", "label": "Coding Sub-Agent / Development Tab (git data)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Not in the original spec; emerged naturally, replacing the dashboard's mock Development tab with real git status/diff data."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_action_endpoints", "label": "Real Action Endpoints (backup, deploy-container)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "First things that mutate the host; deliberate two-step preview-then-confirm flow using a server-issued token, and deliberately excluded from chat's own initiative so Ultron never fakes compliance."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_activity_log", "label": "Real Activity Log (SQLite-backed)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Replaced a mock 'recent activity' feed; logs real backups/deploys/CVE scans with success/failure detail."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_get_repo_diff_tool", "label": "get_repo_diff Chat Tool (parameterized)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "First parameterized chat tool, taking a `repo` argument; required changing the core tool-dispatch mechanism to pass through arbitrary kwargs."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_fifo_engine", "label": "_fifo_engine() Shared Trade Calculation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Refactor into a single shared function for per-disposal tax-lot detail, verified against the exact same hand-computed scenarios as before the refactor to prove zero behavioral drift."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_csv_export", "label": "Trade CSV Export (transactions + tax-lots)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Wired into the dashboard via fetch+Blob (a plain download link can't carry an auth header) and into the Discord bot as a real file attachment."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_remote_access_doc", "label": "REMOTE-ACCESS.md (Tailscale setup)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Researched fresh; found Windows Firewall rules apply to all profiles by default when -Profile is omitted, and that autogroup:self doesn't cover Tailscale-tagged devices."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_cost_controls", "label": "Cost Controls (caching, token budget, rate limit)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Prompt caching with cache breakpoints, a real daily token budget with a verified hard stop (zero API calls once over budget), a request rate limiter, and full usage visibility via /api/chat/usage."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_mcp_support", "label": "MCP (external tool/plugin) Support", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Most security-sensitive feature built. Discovery and execution are separate: connecting a server discovers tools but grants nothing; only tools an operator names in a server's auto_approve list become callable. No in-conversation approval path, on purpose, since a model can't be trusted to resist a forged conversational 'yes' from prompt injection \u2014 the only path to execution is the operator's static config."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_test_mcp_server", "label": "dev-tools/test_mcp_server.py", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A real Flask app implementing the real MCP protocol with strict asserts on request shape, used instead of a mock so it would catch real bugs a lenient mock would hide."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_mcp_empty_notification_bug", "label": "MCP Empty Notification Response Bug", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A 202 Accepted with no body is correct for notifications/initialized, but the client unconditionally tried to JSON-parse every response, raising a false error. Fixed by treating an empty body as {} rather than a parse failure."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_mcp_response_size_cap_bug", "label": "MCP Response-Size Cap Applied at Wrong Layer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The safety cap was applied to raw HTTP bytes, truncating mid-JSON and corrupting structure. Fixed by separating a generous raw read ceiling (2MB backstop) from the user-facing content cap (4,000 chars), applied after successful JSON parsing, to extracted text only."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_discord_backend_get_bug", "label": "Discord backend_get Raw-Error-Text Bug", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "backend_get showed raw response text on errors instead of parsing the JSON error field, unlike backend_post and backend_get_csv; nearly every read-only command showed uglier errors than necessary. Found while building /usage; fixed to match the established correct pattern."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_discord_field_truncation_bug", "label": "Discord Field Truncation Off-by-N Bug", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "value[:1000] + suffix (suffix 33 chars) totaled 1033, over Discord's hard 1024-char field limit. Fixed to compute the truncation point including the suffix length."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_tool_registration_ordering_bug", "label": "get_llm_usage Tool Registration Ordering Bug", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "get_llm_usage was defined after TOOL_DISPATCH referenced it, which would have raised NameError at import time; caught by the routine post-edit syntax check before it ever ran."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_startup_script_ux_trap", "label": "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY Startup Script UX Trap", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY was initially left active with a placeholder value unlike every other optional line (commented out by default), which would cause a confusing auth error instead of a clean 'not configured' message. Fixed to match the commented-out-by-default pattern."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_config_value_hardening", "label": "Config Value Floor Hardening", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ULTRON_LLM_MAX_TOKENS and ULTRON_CHAT_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE originally had no floor; a misconfigured 0 or negative value would silently break chat. Both now clamp to a minimum of 1."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_testing_philosophy", "label": "Testing Philosophy (real services + scriptable fakes)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Verify against something that behaves like the real thing: real SQLite, real local git repos, a real protocol-compliant local MCP server, and end-to-end passes running actual dashboard JS via a Node vm sandbox against a real running backend."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_fake_pkgs", "label": "dev-tools/fake_pkgs/ (anthropic/discord/aiohttp fakes)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Scriptable fakes built to match real SDK shapes closely enough that code written against them needs no changes for the real thing."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_readme", "label": "Top-level README.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_dev_tools_readme", "label": "dev-tools/README.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_explicit_boundaries", "label": "Explicit Safety Boundaries Maintained", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No exploit tooling; no specific trading/investment advice; no chat-initiated host mutation; no trade-record writing via chat; no conversational bypass for MCP approval; every optional feature inert until configured."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_known_gaps", "label": "Known, Deliberate Gaps", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No stdio/local-subprocess MCP transport (HTTP only, smaller risk than spawning arbitrary local processes); no exchange API integration for trades; no CI integration for the Development tab; no raw WireGuard guide (Tailscale only); no automatic background retry for unreachable MCP servers."}, {"id": "project_summary_for_claude_code_discord_bot_parity", "label": "Discord Bot Feature Parity", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every backend feature got a matching bot command as it was built: /repos, /diff, /trades, /portfolio, /export, /backup, /deploy with Confirm/Cancel buttons."}], "edges": [{"source": "project_summary_for_claude_code_ultron", "target": "project_summary_for_claude_code_readme", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "project_summary_for_claude_code_ultron", "target": "project_summary_for_claude_code_dev_tools_readme", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "project_summary_for_claude_code_ultron", "target": "project_summary_for_claude_code_remote_access_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "project_summary_for_claude_code_ultron", "target": "ultron_backend_beta_launch_checklist_phase1_status", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "project_summary_for_claude_code_ultron", "target": "project_summary_for_claude_code_ethical_hacking_agent", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "project_summary_for_claude_code_ultron", "target": "project_summary_for_claude_code_investment_agent", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "project_summary_for_claude_code_ultron", "target": "project_summary_for_claude_code_trade_record_agent", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "project_summary_for_claude_code_ultron", "target": "project_summary_for_claude_code_home_lab_monitor", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "project_summary_for_claude_code_ultron", "target": "project_summary_for_claude_code_coding_subagent", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "PROJECT-SUMMARY-FOR-CLAUDE-CODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": 